      "value": "@{5a570cf1b301553d0104bddd|full_name}: yes but what I encounter time and time again is large amounts of users who turn of ALL particles. I'm just asking for a system that lowers the particle limit, so that people who spend the time animating gestures and doing legitimately cool things is able to show off their work without feeling isolated because everyone blocks their particles by the default safety settings.",
